sequenceDiagram
  participant AI as Parent's AI app
  participant API as Jadwigo API, /api/mcp
  participant AUTH as Supabase Auth, OAuth 2.1
  participant P as Parent
  AI->>API: POST /api/mcp, no token
  API-->>AI: 401, WWW-Authenticate names the metadata
  AI->>API: GET /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource/api/mcp
  API-->>AI: resource, authorization_servers
  AI->>AUTH: authorization request
  AUTH->>P: sign in, then /oauth/consent
  P-->>AUTH: yes
  AUTH-->>AI: access token, at most 1 hour
  AI->>API: POST /api/mcp, tools/call, Bearer token
  API->>API: authorize the member, 1 unit per call
  API-->>AI: the tool's result, only this pod's data
